<section class="hive-triad">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="hive-triad__inner">

            <div class="hive-triad__header">
                <h2 class="hive-triad__title">
                    <span>The Hive Triad:</span>
                    Three Superfoods, One System
                </h2>

                <p class="hive-triad__subtitle">
                    Most brands would call these "three ingredients." They're not.<br>
                    They're three jobs, and each one <br class="mobile-br"> covers a different part of how your
                    body runs.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hive-triad__items">

                <article class="hive-triad__item">
                    <div class="hive-triad__content">

                        <span class="hive-triad__label">
                            THE BUILDING BLOCKS
                        </span>

                        <h3 class="hive-triad__item-title">
                            Bee Bread – 2,500 mg
                        </h3>

                        <p class="hive-triad__text">
                            Raw pollen has a tough outer shell your gut struggles to break down – most
                            of a standard pollen capsule passes right through you. Bee bread is pollen
                            bees have fermented inside the hive: shell cracked open, contents pre-digested.
                            Vitamins, minerals, amino acids, enzymes arrive already unlocked.
                        </p>

                        <a class="hive-triad__link" href="#" data-triad-target="bee-bread">
                            STUDY
                            <svg aria-hidden="true">
                                <use href="#arrow-icon"></use>
                            </svg>
                        </a>

                        <div class="hive-triad__stat">
                            <div class="hive-triad__stat-value">
                                2,500mg
                                <span>per stick</span>
                            </div>

                            <p class="hive-triad__stat-text">
                                5× the dose <br class="mobile-br"> of a standard 500 mg pollen capsule.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <p class="hive-triad__description">
                            The raw-materials half of the system – whole, fermented food your body
                            recognizes, not isolated synthetics it has to sort out.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                    <div class="hive-triad__media">
                        <picture>
                            <source media="(max-width: 650px)" srcset="{{ 'bee-bread-mobile.avif' | file_url }}"
                                type="image/avif">
                            <source media="(max-width: 650px)" srcset="{{ 'bee-bread-mobile.webp' | file_url }}"
                                type="image/webp">
                            <source srcset="{{ 'bee-bread.avif' | file_url }}" type="image/avif">
                            <img src="{{ 'bee-bread.webp' | file_url }}" alt="bee bread" fetchpriority="low" loading="lazy"
